LOAM-OCAML-ACTUAL-FIXTURE	2
EVENT	a	2026-09-30
EFFECT	wallet	jpy	-100
EFFECT	food	jpy	100
END-EVENT
EVENT	b	2026-10-01
EFFECT	wallet	jpy	-150
EFFECT	food	jpy	150
EFFECT	wallet	usd	7
EFFECT	offset	usd	-7
END-EVENT
EVENT	x	2026-10-02
EFFECT	wallet	jpy	-10
EFFECT	food	jpy	10
END-EVENT
CORRECTION	a	b
ZERO-ORIGIN	food	jpy
ZERO-ORIGIN	quiet	jpy
GROUP
REFLECT	a
ASSERT	wallet	jpy	1000
ASSERT	empty	jpy	0
END-GROUP
GROUP
REFLECT	a
REFLECT	x
ASSERT	wallet	usd	5
END-GROUP
END
